task: intent-static-trigrams-and-pca
agent: fable-persist
started: 2026-09-07
branch: feature/intent-static-trigrams-and-pca
worktree: ../okay-wt-static

why: two extensions of the static table filed "rather than guessed":
  pairs were worth 11.6 points over words, so triples are the same
  argument once more with diminishing returns and a bigger table; and
  model2vec's PCA step cuts 1024 dimensions to 256, which decides
  whether a production vocabulary ships (30k units at 1024 float32 is
  120 MB). Both are one distillation each against the rozum gateway
  (http://127.0.0.1:8089/v1/embeddings, up: Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B).

what: in TestStatic (Live): distil words+pairs, words+pairs+triples;
  fit PCA on the words+pairs table (centred, power iteration) and
  project to 256 and 128; the same probe/centroid evaluation on the
  same split; report accuracy, units, bytes. A gain of less than the
  spread already measured on this fixture is reported as none.
  Static gains a `pca(table, k)` only if it wins; otherwise the
  numbers land in the spec and the entry closes as measured.
